OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FSome
OL,6,Fpleasant spells of warm sunshine on
OL,7,FMonday with light winds. Strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds on Tuesday and unseasonably
OL,9,Fwarm, some rain later. Fresher and
OL,10,Fbreezy on Wednesday with sunshine and
OL,11,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
